  "id": "BIT-parse-2026-116161",
  "summary": "Parse Server 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 LiveQuery Information Disclosure via $or Subscriptions",
  "details": "Parse Server before 8.6.103 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 contains an information disclosure vulnerability in LiveQuery. Its subscription hash omits constraints next to a $or operator, including the _Session owner filter and beforeSubscribe constraints, so distinct subscriptions are grouped together. Authenticated clients subscribing with $or queries can receive other users' events, including session tokens usable for impersonation.",
